{% comment %}
  Text shown in the header top bar promotion carousel for a product.

  Priority:
  1. Product metafield custom.topbar_promotion_label (e.g. "Shop for Owl")
  2. product-display-title (Short name metafield, else full product title)

  Merchants: Settings → Custom data → Products → add Single line text,
  namespace custom, key topbar_promotion_label, name e.g. "Top bar promo label".
{% endcomment %}
{% if product.metafields.custom.topbar_promotion_label.value != blank %}
  {{- product.metafields.custom.topbar_promotion_label.value | strip | escape -}}
{% else %}
  {% render 'product-display-title', product: product %}
{% endif %}
